Date: Sun, 2 Aug 2026 07:43:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: SMART_EVENT_MOVIE_COMPLETED SAI event via
 CMSG_COMPLETE_MOVIE (I-276)

- Handle CMSG_COMPLETE_MOVIE (0x465), previously discarded (Handle_NULL)
- Player::SendMovieStart remembers the pending movie id; the completion
  packet carries no payload
- Player::CompletedMovie fires SMART_EVENT_MOVIE_COMPLETED (113) on
  creatures within 150y, invoker = player; fires on skip too
- Lets scripted scenes start when the movie leaves the screen instead of
  racing it (Doc Zapnozzle revive RP played behind the goblin cinematic)

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
